<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Identity Reveal Request - AffinityEcho</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #4b5563; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f3f4f6;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);">
        <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9333ea 0%, #4f46e5 50%, #3b82f6 100%); padding: 40px; text-align: center; color: white;">
            <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700;">Identity Reveal Request</h1>
            <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; opacity: 0.9; font-size: 16px;">A connection wants to know who you are</p>
        </div>

        <div style="padding: 40px;">
            <p>Hello <strong style="color: #9333ea;"><%= username %></strong>,</p>
            <p style="font-size: 16px;">One of your connections has requested an identity reveal. This means they'd like to share real identities with you.</p>

            <div style="background: #faf5ff; border: 1px solid #e9d5ff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #9333ea; font-weight: 600;">What is an identity reveal?</p>
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #4b5563;">When both parties accept, your real names and profiles will be visible to each other. This is a mutual action - both sides must agree.</p>
            </div>

            <div style="background: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid #fde68a; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #92400e; font-weight: 600;">Your privacy is in your hands</p>
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #92400e;">You are under no obligation to accept. If you're not comfortable revealing your identity, simply decline the request. Your anonymity will remain intact.</p>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
                <a href="<%= viewUrl %>" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #9333ea; color: white; padding: 14px 36px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;">Review Request</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #f9fafb; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 14px;">You're receiving this because a connection requested an identity reveal.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af;">Need help? Contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" style="color: #4f46e5;"><%= supportEmail %></a></p>
            <p style="margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af;">&copy; 2025 AffinityEcho. Building stronger professionals together.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
